\{(4\pi-2\theta)/T,\ 4\pi/T,\ -2\theta/T,\ 0\}.
\]

Thus `||H2||=4pi/T<16/T`. Because all three terms of (5) commute,

\[
e^{-iTH_2}=e^{-i(2\pi-\theta)}e^{-i2\pi ZZ}e^{i\theta XX}
=e^{i\theta}e^{i\theta XX}=W.
