Since `J` has four orthonormal columns,

\[
\|VJ\|_F\le2v,\quad
\|S_1\|\le\|S_1\|_F\le2v/\delta,
\quad \|S_2\|\le\|S_2\|_F\le2v^2/\delta^2.
